{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"The sound of a woman's voice, unyielding and proud speaks true. Her voice is determined, without fault. The voice encapsulates your mind. Instead of a void of black where your thoughts dwell, it is a void of white light that pulses as she speaks","created_at":"2020-08-08T21:03:10.376000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741763460895080509","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"||You believe in preservation. Your fondness of memory holds it. Although yours does not recollect all, your faith believes it to be true. To honor those in death as they deserved in life. You have gone through much pain, abandoned. Your faith is to one that many consider taboo to openly worship. Yet, your heart stands true against the river that guides the Raven Queen's alternative worshippers astray. You have questions, I see them, you have doubts, I know them. But they do not become you||","created_at":"2020-08-08T21:07:08.060000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741764457814032497","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Lilia looks at Excalibur in her hand. || \"Many consider the Raven Queen evil. She isn't. Some might say the same of me when they find out I am fallen. But I'm not. I fight to keep people alive, and if they die I honor them. Of the Gods lost to time, I wish to honor them as well.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-08T21:11:37.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741765589017690143","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
